            quietMs: quietMs,
            lastConsumedBucket: 0,
            probedSinceLastConsumption: false,
          ),
          HeadlessLivenessAction.wait,
        );
        expect(
          headlessJobLivenessAction(
            elapsedMs: 10 * 60 * 1000,
            quietMs: quietMs,
            lastConsumedBucket: 2,
